Package: libkf5cgroups5
Architecture: linux-any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: systemd, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
XB-Bugs: https://github.com/Sparky-OS/sparky-stereo-os/issues
Description: KDE library to control the cgroup resources of running applications
 KCGroups lists the running applications and their systemd units and
 changes their control group resources (CPU weight, memory limits)
 through systemd's D-Bus interface.
 .
 This is Natalie Vock's fork (https://github.com/pixelcluster/kcgroups,
 branch dmemcg, tag kcgroups-dmemcg-experimental) of KDE's kcgroups by
 Henri Chain and Kevin Ottens, built with Qt 6. It adds the device memory
 low protection of the dmem cgroup controller (Linux 7.3), which
 plasma-foreground-booster sets on the window in front.

Package: libkf5cgroups-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: linux-any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libkf5cgroups5 (= ${binary:Version}), qt6-base-dev, ${misc:Depends}
XB-Bugs: https://github.com/Sparky-OS/sparky-stereo-os/issues
Description: KDE cgroups library of running applications, development files
 The headers and CMake configuration (KF5CGroups, the KF5::CGroups target)
 of the dmem fork of KCGroups, built with Qt 6, for building
 plasma-foreground-booster.
